{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARE YOU WORTHY?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CyberArena is a fast-paced top-down arena shooter with roguelike mechanics, inspired by hits such as <i>Vampire Survivors</i> and <i>Hotline Miami</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The desert world no longer belongs to humanity. Beyond the technocratic enclaves lie only sand, massive predatory insects, and arcane heretics. To preserve what remains of civilization, the Technocracy Council trains new mech pilots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a combat mech and fight against waves of hostile machines. Every run is unique \u2014 collect upgrades, experiment with builds, and push toward the end through the chaos of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WILL YOU SURVIVE?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pace is relentless! Slow time, boost your firepower, and crush the enemy! Endless hordes close in from all sides!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each wave, you choose from random upgrades: combat modules, enhancers, experimental technologies. The deeper you go, the more aggressive the arena becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive. Prove your worth. Become a mech pilot \u2014 or vanish into the sands, like thousands before you\u2026</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New user detected","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3751810/8ff334b3a2e636ae9011b0dd8d1474483ea7f33f.jpg"},{"name":"Eradicator\u201110","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3751810/f32243151f14e8e88b32662b03842faf02077639.jpg"},{"name":"Eradicator\u201150","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3751810/db259ea5dc52fff209e3cb3ce05db89eb20d42d4.jpg"},{"name":"Eradicator\u2011100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3751810/9cdb87fd8e4e16c881ee87ccfa7917b930e33a03.